{"schema_version":"1.0","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/clinical-reasoning/low-back-pain/","title":"요통의 한의학적 임상 추론","language":"ko-KR","description":"요통을 급만성·통증양상·어혈·풍한습비·허손으로 구분하고 침구·독활기생탕·현대근거로 연결합니다.","text":"요통의 한의학적 임상 추론\n1. 먼저 보는 것\n통증 위치·발병 시점·움직임과의 관계·하지 증상·기능 제한 등을 살핀다.\n2. 변증\n요통\n├─ 고정·오래된 통증 → 어혈 고려\n├─ 냉·습과 연동 → 풍한습비\n└─ 만성 + 허약 → 간신·기혈허\n3. 치료\n국소·경락 치료:\n- 침\n- 약침\n- 전침\n- 부항\n경혈:\n- 신수 BL23\n- 위중 BL40\n방제:\n→ 독활기생탕\n→ 요통 근거 카드","sections":[{"title":"1. 먼저 보는 것","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/clinical-reasoning/low-back-pain/#1","text":"통증 위치·발병 시점·움직임과의 관계·하지 증상·기능 제한 등을 살핀다.","links":[]},{"title":"2. 변증","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/clinical-reasoning/low-back-pain/#2","text":"요통\n├─ 고정·오래된 통증 → 어혈 고려\n├─ 냉·습과 연동 → 풍한습비\n└─ 만성 + 허약 → 간신·기혈허","links":[]},{"title":"3. 치료","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/clinical-reasoning/low-back-pain/#3","text":"국소·경락 치료:\n- 침\n- 약침\n- 전침\n- 부항\n경혈:\n- 신수 BL23\n- 위중 BL40\n방제:\n→ 독활기생탕\n→ 요통 근거 카드","links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/points/bl23-shenshu/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/points/bl40-weizhong/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/conditions/low-back-pain/#back-research","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/formulas/duhuo-jisheng-tang/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/treatments/acupuncture/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/treatments/cupping/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/treatments/electroacupuncture/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/treatments/pharmacopuncture/"]}],"headings":[{"level":2,"title":"1. 먼저 보는 것","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/clinical-reasoning/low-back-pain/#1"},{"level":2,"title":"2. 변증","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/clinical-reasoning/low-back-pain/#2"},{"level":2,"title":"3. 치료","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/clinical-reasoning/low-back-pain/#3"}],"links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/points/bl23-shenshu/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/points/bl40-weizhong/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/conditions/low-back-pain/#back-research","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/formulas/duhuo-jisheng-tang/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/treatments/acupuncture/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/treatments/cupping/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/treatments/electroacupuncture/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/treatments/pharmacopuncture/"],"related_reading":[],"interpretation":"Public article text and navigation only; links do not establish clinical equivalence or treatment recommendations.","provenance":{"document_id":"MSA-E52F1853D59318FD","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/clinical-reasoning/low-back-pain/","text_sha256":"bff9293cf6cb1ea90e6f8968e793a79e3bfb2b740a8e1c5975d1d022da7e2d13","source_sha256":"713087a2555b705702adbafa071c5e981899b513fe20bbb561435dbcab8d26e6","commit":"fb0ad548a562ee75fd69ab85758e02f5044a2c94"}}
